    "notes": {
        "c084f3b8-c123-4d1a-8cc5-bfea37329930": {
            "x": 64,
            "y": 688,
            "width": 736,
            "height": 288,
            "content": "## Test data assumption: a hotel with reviews and a competitor set\n\nRevinate has no sandbox. The first hotel the connected Revinate Reputation account can access must have at least one review, a competitor set configured in Revinate Reputation, and at least one review of a competitor. Without a competitor set Find Competitor Hotels answers on its Not Found port and the flow times out.\n\nIf the first hotel of the account is a corporate (group) account without reviews of its own, set the Hotel inputs to a property that has them.\n\nThis flow has never been run: no Revinate test credentials existed when the connector was built."
        }
    }
